    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ea1932d57e9444ce",
      "translationZh": "什么是 SegMoE？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61e849759d62e850",
      "translationZh": "SegMoE 模型采用与 Stable Diffusion 相同的架构。与 Mixtral 8x7b 一样，一个 SegMoE 模型集成了多个模型。其工作方式是将部分前馈层替换为稀疏 MoE 层。MoE 层包含一个路由网络，用于选择由哪些专家来最高效地处理哪些词元。你可以使用 segmoe 包创建自己的 MoE 模型！整个过程只需几分钟。如需更多信息，请访问 Github 仓库。我们在设计 segmoe 时借鉴了广受欢迎的 mergekit 库。感谢 mergekit 的贡献者提供了如此实用的库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f06fa0ba7654625e",
      "translationZh": "有关 MoE 的更多详细信息，请参阅 Hugging Face 🤗 的文章：hf.co/blog/moe。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "050f4caa083e25de",
      "translationZh": "SegMoE 发布要点速览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0014c13fd6b72a7a",
      "translationZh": "发布 SegMoE-4x2、SegMoE-2x1 和 SegMoE-SD4x2 版本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd2beeb98c7e2328",
      "translationZh": "发布用于制作自定义 MoE 的代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2b0560e220d8dcfc",
      "translationZh": "关于命名",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03b49866aa6cb205",
      "translationZh": "SegMoE 的 MoE 模型命名为 SegMoE-AxB，其中 A 表示通过 MoE 方式组合在一起的专家模型数量，第二个数字则表示参与每张图像生成的专家数量。根据配置设置，仅复制模型的部分层（前馈块、注意力层，或全部层）；其余参数与 Stable Diffusion 模型相同。有关 MoE 工作原理的更多详细信息，请参阅《混合专家详解》（Mixture of Experts Explained）一文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ae5b8a4c6ac9aa79",
      "translationZh": "推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
