    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "479dfb82d7f82d2f",
      "translationZh": "注意：同时支持 Hugging Face 和 CivitAI 模型。对于 CivitAI 模型，请粘贴模型的下载链接，例如：\"https://civitai.com/api/download/models/239306\"",
